# PostgreSQL password. Compose seeds the database with this on the first
# `docker compose up -d`, and webapp/.env must carry the SAME value inside
# DATABASE_URL — the two examples ship `change-me` so a verbatim copy works.
#
# Note: the password is baked into the data volume when the db container first
# initialises. Changing it later needs the volume recreated (`make down` plus
# `docker volume rm darkflow_darkflow-db`), not just an edit here.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change-me
